<title>UK: Bodycote soars on results, upbeat comment.</title>
<headline>Bodycote soars on results, upbeat comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bodycote International Plc shares surged 27-1/2p to 765p on Wednesday after results beat forecasts and the company made bullish comments about this year's performance, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's the results. They look good,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profits came in at 27.2 million stg for 1996, a rise of 48 percent, against expectations of 24.5 million to 26.7 million.</p>
<p>The engineering services group also said trading for the first quarter of 1997 was strong and that it was looking foward to another successful year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
